110526
	read_PTY_pipe:
	replace strlen(buf) to rlen, allow incoming codes \0 to be parsed

	.
	terminal reset properties changed, new CAP :is: code to reset terminal 

	.
	save_keymap to file "%USERPROFILE%\\TinyTerm7.keymap"
	all lines of current keymap will be stored

	load keymap from file "%USERPROFILE%\\TinyTerm7.keymap"
	found lines will be added to current keymap

	TinyTerm7.keymap line format 
	" VK_KEY { \, size \  (size?str:'') }[KEY_MODS] \;\n"
	    "VK_KEY" unsigned in range 0-255
	    "size" unsigned in range 0-32 (strlen(str))
	    	check is only single space between size and str records
		(optional) "str" in binary form [size] chars 

	TinyTerm7.keymap is autoloaded the same as TinyTerm7.cfg

.	

